**Recommendations :** 

Botium Toys should ensure its security posture by foundational security controls. 

Proper Intrusion detection systems and SEIM tools should be installed for threat detection and monitoring. 

Secure password policies should be implemented like measuring password strength and accepting at least 8 characters (mix of numbers, letters and special characters) . Additionally, Multi-factor authentication should be implemented to enhance access security.

Proper disaster recovery plans and backup options should be implemented in case of system failures.

The company should ensure defense in depth by adding security controls across systems, network and physical assets.
